  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MRC 2007 - June 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRC 2007</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till Mekongflodens flodkommission (MRC) utg&#xE5;r under perioden 2007 till 2009. Sverige har st&#xF6;tt MRC under m&#xE5;nga &#xE5;r och speciellt fokuserat p&#xE5; att st&#xF6;tta milj&#xF6;programmet, fiskeprogrammet, Basin development plan samt genom institutionellt st&#xF6;d till sekretariatet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden has supported the Mekong River Commission (MRC) for many years, focusing in particular on the Environment Programme (EP), the Basin Development Plan (BDP), the Fisheries Programme(FP) and on Institutional Support (IS). The agreement covers the three-year period 2007-2009 and will help the MRC to achieve the goals set out in its 2006-2010 Strategic Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
